SNECKO-BELITTLE.description:
Enemy loses {ExtraDamage:diff()} HP for each unique debuff they have.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon Debuff.}{IsTargeting:cond:
(Loses {CalculatedDamage:diff()} HP)|}

SNECKO-COBRA_COIL.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Enemy takes {SneckoConstrictPower:diff()} damage at the end of each of its turns.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Rare Attack.}

SNECKO-COMBO_STRING.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage for each [gold]Offclass[/gold] card played this turn.{InCombat:cond:
(Hits {Repeat:diff()} {Repeat:plural:time|times})|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.}

SNECKO-DEFENSIVE_FLAIR.description:
Gain {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold],
increased by {CalculationExtra:diff()} for each [gold]Offclass[/gold] card in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.}

SNECKO-FINAL_STRIKE.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Repeat for each unique card containing “Strike” you've played this combat.
{InCombat:cond:(Hits {UniqueStrikesPlayed:diff()} {UniqueStrikesPlayed:plural:time|times})|Gift: Strike.}

SNECKO-MAKESHIFT_BLADE.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
If the target has at least {Debuffs:diff()} debuffs, draw {Cards:diff()} cards.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Debuff.}

SNECKO-OTHERWORLDLY_SLASH.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
If you played an [gold]Offclass[/gold] card this turn, deal {Damage:diff()} damage again.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Common.}

SNECKO-SLITHER_THROUGH.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Reduce the cost of [gold]Offclass[/gold] cards in your [gold]Hand[/gold] by {Energy:energyIcons()} this turn.{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.}

SNECKO-TOOTH_AND_CLAW.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage.
Add a [gold]Shiv{IfUpgraded:show:+|}[/gold] into your [gold]Hand[/gold] for each unique color in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Uncommon.}

SNECKO-WIDE_STING.description:
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage to ALL enemies.
[gold]Upgrade[/gold] all [gold]Offclass[/gold] cards in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:cond:|
[gold]Gift[/gold]: Common.}
